-- title:
--   Loaded coordinate queries, Gaussian scalar regrouping, and verification data
-- statement:
--   This package defines the native coordinate-query data, fair-bit schedules and raw preprocessor interfaces, Gaussian scalar projection and block-product data, verification input parser, and one-call Gaussian regrouping machine. It retains the original fresh random inputs, scalar/block shapes, encodings and actual program definitions. Their uniformity, QPT resource certificates and probability equalities are separate theorem submissions.
